| Goal ID | Goal Title                 | Text                                                                 | Runtime Annotation                     | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1      | Deliver Food               | Ensure food is delivered to the inpatient room according to orders.  | -                                      | Perform   | -        |
| G2      | Check Retrieval Capability | Determine if the inpatient, companion, nurse, or robot can retrieve the meal. | FALLBACK(QueryInpatientAbility, QueryCompanionAvailability, QueryNurseAvailability, QueryRobotAvailability) | Query     | G1       |
| G3      | Deliver Food to Room       | Deliver the food to the inpatient room using either direct placement or tray delivery. | FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2)                   | Perform   | G1       |
| G4      | Track Meal Retrieval       | Ensure accurate tracking of which meal was retrieved by whom and when. | -                                      | Achieve   | G1       |
| G5      | Retrieve Dirty Dishes      | Collect dirty dishes from the inpatient room with possible cooperation. | FALLBACK(G5.1, G5.2)                   | Perform   | G1       |

| Task ID | Task Title             | Text                                           | Relation | Location          | Number of Robots |
|---------|------------------------|------------------------------------------------|----------|-------------------|------------------|
| AT1     | Indicate Meal          | Specify which meal corresponds to the inpatient. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |
| AT2     | Track Retrieval        | Log when and where each meal was retrieved.    | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |
| AT3     | Alert Wrong Meal       | Notify if an incorrect meal is retrieved.      | AND      | Inpatient Room    | 1                |
| AT4     | Collect Dishes         | Retrieve dirty dishes from the room.           | AND      | Inpatient Room    | [1,2]            |
| AT5     | Open Room Door         | Unlock the room door with cooperation if needed. | AND      | Inpatient Room    | [1,2]            |

**Logical Relationships:**

- **G1 -> G2, G3, G4, G5 [AND]**  
  The main goal (deliver food) requires all sub-goals to be fulfilled.

- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2 [FALLBACK]**  
  Delivery can be achieved by either placing the meal directly (G3.1) or leaving it for retrieval (G3.2), with fallback between these options.

- **G3.1 -> AT6 [AND]**  
  Direct placement requires a task to place the meal on the table (not explicitly listed but implied).

- **G3.2 -> G2, AT1, AT3 [AND]**  
  Tray delivery requires checking retrieval capability (G2), indicating the meal (AT1), and alerting on errors (AT3).

- **G5 -> G5.1, G5.2 [FALLBACK]**  
  Dish retrieval can be done by opening the door (G5.1) or using cooperation (G5.2).

- **G5.1 -> AT5 [AND]**  
  Opening the door requires the task of unlocking it (AT5).

- **G5.2 -> AT4 [AND]**  
  Dish collection with cooperation requires the task of collecting dishes (AT4).
